     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div>Greetings, <div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(32,31,30);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">I don’t see how a fully standardized EPC larger than 1 is possible. But my CFA analysis produced completely standardized epc greater than 6. </span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(32,31,30);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(32,31,30);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">Thank you for your explanation. </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(32,31,30);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><br></span></div><div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">&gt; modificationIndices(fit, sort.=TRUE, minimum.value=3)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">             lhs op            rhs      mi    epc <a href=\"http://sepc.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sepc.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422802400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02S2_y9U63mhNItPMuEJ6G\">sepc.lv</a> sepc.all</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">18 MOSSB_CONFIDE ~~     MOSSB_TURN 241.751  1.246   1.246    6.442</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">27    MOSSB_LOVE ~~ MOSSB_TOGETHER 106.408  0.502   0.502    0.505</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">26    MOSSB_HELP ~~ MOSSB_TOGETHER  66.014  0.437   0.437    0.392</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px\">25    MOSSB_HELP ~~     MOSSB_LOVE  54.225  0.426   0.426    0.354</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#201f1e\